nt\" class=\"flex-1 scroll-mt-[88px]\"><main id=\"profile-page\"><section id=\"hero-profile\" class=\"relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"parallax-container absolute inset-0 bg-crown-club bg-cover bg-position-[center_top_20rem] 3xl:bg-position-[center_top_1rem] bg-no-repeat\" style=\"transform:translateY(0px)\"></div><div class=\"image-container [clip-path:polygon(0_0,100%_0,100%_98%,0_92%)]\"><div class=\"relative h-[50svh]\"><img alt=\"Clara Wu Tsai - Brooklyn Sports &amp; Entertainment Leadership\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero%2Fmobile-about-us.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero%2Fmobile-about-us.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero%2Fmobile-about-us.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero%2Fmobile-about-us.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero%2Fmobile-about-us.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero%2Fmobile-about-us.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero%2Fmobile-about-us.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero%2Fmobile-about-us.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero%2Fmobile-about-us.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div><div class=\"w-full text-light px-5 lg:px-14 2xl:px-20 max-w-screen-xl absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-center z-10\"><h1 class=\"text-light! uppercase text-4xl md:text-5xl xl:text-6xl 2xl:text-7xl mb-4\">Clara Wu Tsai</h1><p class=\"text-base lg:text-lg mb-0!\">Vice-Chair, Brooklyn Sports &amp; Entertainment</p><p class=\"text-base lg:text-lg\">Governor, New York Liberty</p></div></section><section><div class=\"px-5 py-10 lg:p-14\"><div class=\"max-w-screen-3xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[360px_1fr] gap-10 lg:gap-14\"><aside class=\"lg:sticky lg:top-24 self-start\"><div class=\"border border-[#efefef] bg-white/5 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/5] w-full bg-white/5\"><img alt=\"Clara Wu Tsai\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1024px) 360px, 100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fheadshots%2Fclara-wu-tsai.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fheadshots%2Fclara-wu-tsai.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fheadshots%2Fclara-wu-tsai.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fheadshots%2Fclara-wu-tsai.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fheadshots%2Fclara-wu-tsai.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fheadshots%2Fclara-wu-tsai.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fheadshots%2Fclara-wu-tsai.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fheadshots%2Fclara-wu-tsai.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fheadshots%2Fclara-wu-tsai.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></aside><article class=\"prose prose-invert max-w-none prose-p:text-white/85 prose-headings:text-white prose-a:text-white\"><p>Clara Wu Tsai is a businesswoman, investor, and philanthropist. Ms. Wu Tsai is the Governor and an owner of the WNBA&#x27;s New York Liberty and an owner of the NBA&#x27;s Brooklyn Nets. As Vice Chair of Brooklyn Sports &amp; Entertainment, she oversees fan development, civic and community engagement, and the role Barclays Center plays within Brooklyn.</p><p>As Founder of the Joe and Clara Tsai Foundation, Ms. Wu Tsai pursues philanthropic investments across the arts, science and social justice spaces. She established the Social Justice Fund in 2020 and is a founding partner of the REFORM Alliance.</p><p>In science and technology, the Foundation supports the Wu Tsai Neurosciences Institute at Stanford University and the Wu Tsai Institute at Yale University. In 2020, Ms. Wu Tsai founded the Wu Tsai Human Performance Alliance, working across six universities.</p><p>Ms. Wu Tsai serves on the Boards of Trustees for Stanford University, New York Presbyterian Hospital and Lincoln Center for the Performing Arts. She has executive produced <em>Into the Okavango</em>, <em>Blue Bayou</em>, and <em>Unfinished Business</em>.</p><p>Previously, Ms. Wu Tsai held leadership roles at Taobao and American Express. She holds degrees from Stanford University and an M.B.A. from Harvard University.</p></article></div></div></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"bg-black text-white pt-12 pb-4 px-5 lg:px-16 border-t-2 border-copper\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-6 lg:flex-row max-w-screen-3xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"mb-5 col-span-6 xl:col-span-2\"><address class=\"my-4 not-italic\">168 39th St, 7th Floor <br/> Brooklyn, NY 11232</address><p class=\"text-sm!\"><strong>Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion Commitment:</strong> We are dedicated to fostering a diverse, inclusive, and equitable community. We embrace and celebrate differences in race, ethnicity, gender, sexual orientation, ability, age, and perspectives. Our commitment is to ensure equal opportunities and create an environment where everyone feels respected, heard, and valued.</p></div><nav class=\"footer-navigation col-span-full flex justify-start xl:col-span-4 xl:justify-end\" aria-label=\"Footer Navigation\"><ul class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start! text-sm!\"><li data-title=\"About Us\"><a class=\"\" href=\"/about-us\">About Us</a></li><li data-title=\"Our Brands\"><a class=\"\" href=\"/our-brands\">Our Brands</a></li><li data-title=\"Impact\"><a class=\"\" href=\"/impact\">Impact</a></li><li data-title=\"News\"><a class=\"\" href=\"/news\">News</a></li><li data-title=\"Careers\"><a class=\"\" href=\"/careers\">Careers</a></